+   buffer. Skipping the byte-order pass there would leave gMfsRamArea big-endian,
+   Mfs_GetDirectoryIndex would never match MFS_FILE_ATTR_DIRECTORY, and the editors' file
+   picker would come up empty with no error: exactly the silent failure this pass exists to
+   prevent. */
